# Client-Side Template CRUD API Implementation Project

## 🎯 **Objective**
Create comprehensive client-side API endpoints in ApiService.java that correspond to the newly implemented modular Template CRUD API routes on the server side. Update Template.java model to support all the new fields from the enhanced Template.js schema. The goal is to maintain centralized server-side logic while providing a complete client-side interface for all template operations across the 8 major modules (Core, Monetization, Metrics, AI, Categorization, Visibility, Customization, Legacy).

## 🧩 **Related Files**
- **app/src/main/java/com/ds/eventwish/data/remote/ApiService.java** - Main API interface (3,735 lines) - ✅ **COMPLETED** with 244+ endpoints
- **app/src/main/java/com/ds/eventwish/data/model/Template.java** - Template model (407 lines) - ✅ **COMPLETED** with 40+ new fields
- **backend/routes/templates/index.js** - Server-side main template router with 8 modules
- **backend/routes/templates/core/** - Core content API endpoints (15 endpoints)
- **backend/routes/templates/monetization/** - Monetization API endpoints (18 endpoints)
- **backend/routes/templates/metrics/** - Metrics API endpoints (46 endpoints)
- **backend/routes/templates/ai/** - AI metadata API endpoints (37 endpoints)
- **backend/routes/templates/categorization/** - Categorization API endpoints (59 endpoints)
- **backend/routes/templates/visibility/** - Visibility API endpoints (25 endpoints)
- **backend/routes/templates/customization/** - Customization API endpoints (14 endpoints)
- **backend/routes/templates/legacy/** - Legacy API endpoints (30 endpoints)
- **backend/models/Template.js** - Server-side Template schema with 40+ fields
- **app/src/main/java/com/ds/eventwish/data/model/response/TemplateResponse.java** - Response wrapper
- **app/src/main/java/com/ds/eventwish/data/converter/** - Type converters for Room database

